Package: imfeatures
Type: Package
Title: Extract Visual Features from 2D Images
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Bradley",
                  family = "Buchsbaum",
                  role = c("aut", "cre"),
                  email = "brad.buchsbaum@gmail.com")
Description: Provides tools for extracting visual features from 2D images using
    deep learning models and traditional computer vision techniques. Includes
    support for VGG16, ResNet, and other pre-trained models through Python
    integration, as well as methods for computing edge entropy, multiscale
    entropy, and feature similarity metrics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://bbuchsbaum.github.io/imfeatures/, https://github.com/bbuchsbaum/imfeatures
